      <title>Bitcoin Drops Below $77,000 as Binance Hack Shakes Crypto</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-30/bitcoin-drops-on-binance-hack-as-stock-selloff-also-weighs</link>
